      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to market with Tony Donnelly of Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\n1866 Lourdesville, Kildare Town, Co. Kildare (R51 F634) is a beautifully 3-bedroom end-of-terrace family home, significantly enhanced by a substantial rear kitchen extension, downstairs bathroom and clever attic conversion, highly functional rear access through a solid block-built shed. This exceptionally spacious property blends the comfort of an established, mature neighbourhood with modern, open-plan living, making it a perfect option for growing families or first-time buyers.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tExtended Layout: Large, bright kitchen extension at the rear.\r\n•\tBonus Attic Space: Clever conversion ideal for a home office.\r\n•\tFunctional Outbuilding: Solid block shed providing secure rear access.\r\n•\tPrime Location: Walking distance to Kildare Town and Train Station & all local amenities, primary and secondary schools.\r\n•\tRetail Close By: Just minutes from Kildare Village shopping outlet, Tesco, Aldi, Lidl stores\r\nAccommodation Overview\r\n•\tGround Floor: The traditional layout opens into a cozy front living room, leading through to a spectacular, light-filled kitchen and dining extension. This contemporary heart of the home serves as a fantastic open-plan family hub with direct access to the rear garden, downstairs bathroom.\r\n•\tFirst Floor: Features three well-proportioned bedrooms and a modern family shower room, maintaining its original practical footprint.\r\n•\tSecond Floor: A staircase leads up to a bright, versatile converted attic space, complete with skylights and built-in eave storage.\r\n•\tExterior & Outbuildings: The private rear garden features a robust, full-width block-built shed which provides excellent utility, secure outdoor storage, and unique, direct rear access.\r\n\r\n\r\n                                     This property is definitely worth viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
